\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  stocks,  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2  slip as c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 454 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Oktober 2007\par 16:50\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO, Oct 8 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's stock market slipped early on Monday from a record high, and the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for the first time in nearly two months.   \par \par \uc2 The Bovespa index <.BVSP> of the Sao Paulo Stock Exchange was down 0.19 percent at 62,202.8 points by noon, with shares of mining giant CVRD helping to push the market lower. The index, which has gained about 40 percent this year, surged to an all-time high of 62,337.9 on Friday.   \par \par \uc2 Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real <BRBY>, was off 0.44 percent at 1.812 per U.S. dollar, extending losses after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  called an auction to buy dollars on the spot \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for the first time since Aug. 13.   \par \par \uc2 The bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  after the real closed on Friday at its strongest level since August 2000. The real has rallied almost 20 percent so far this year, buoyed by strong dollar inflows to Latin America's largest economy.   \par \par \uc2 "This is one more sign that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  believes that the worst of the crisis afflicting global markets has passed," said Vladimir Caramaschi, chief economist at Fator Corretora, a Sao Paulo brokerage.   \par \par \uc2 "But I don't think the bank is going to be able to prevent the real from strengthening further," he added. "The dollar inflows into the country are too strong."   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  called the auction on an unusually quiet day in the market due to the Columbus Day holiday in the United States, which reduced trading volumes significantly.   \par \par \uc2 Interest rate futures <0#DIJ:> on the BM&F commodities and futures exchange in Sao Paulo rose slightly, mirroring the downturn in the stock and \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets.   \par \par \uc2 At the Bovespa, CVRD -- the second-heaviest-weighted stock in the index -- dragged the market lower. CVRD shares tumbled 1.06 percent to 50.64 reais after  \uc2 UBS\uc2  Pactual cut its recommendation on the stock to "neutral" from "buy."   \par \par \uc2 JP Morgan\uc2  took a similar step last week, lowering its recommendation on CVRD shares to "neutral" from "overweight."   \par \par \uc2 State-run oil giant  \uc2 Petrobras\uc2  , the heaviest weighted stock in the Bovespa index, was among the few shares posting gains.  \uc2 Petrobras\uc2  shares were up 0.18 percent at 61.26 reais, preventing the Bovespa from falling further.   \par \par \uc2 Another actively traded stock posting gains was aircraft manufacturer Embraer , whose shares rose 2.34 percent to 22.26 reais. On Friday, Embraer said it delivered 47 jets in the third quarter, up from just 30 in the year-earlier period.   \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-BRAZIL|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|M|D|U|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020071008e3a8001ep\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
