\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, buying an unspecified quantity of dollars at BRL1.9425.   \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, in local interest rate markets Monday, the rate on the most actively traded futures contract, January 2010, fell to 10.32% from 10.35% at Friday's close. Brazil's interbank overnight rate held steady at 11.89%.   \par \par \uc2 -By Gerald Jeffris, Dow Jones Newswires; (5561) 4501-7143; gerald.jeffrisdowjones.com   \par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires   \par \par \uc2 06-11-07 1536ET   \par \par \uc2 Dokument OSTDJ00020070611e36b002hk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
