n real by removing real exposure from the market.   \par \par \uc2 The real could start strengthening again later Monday, if weekly trade figures to be published later in the morning are strong.   \par \par \uc2 Brazil's trade surplus this year through May totals $16.854 billion, up from $15.453 billion in the same period of 2006. The strong trade surplus has been one of the main factors bolstering the real.   \par \par \uc2 In local interest rate futures, the most actively traded contract, January 2008, rose to 11.31% from Friday's close at 11.29%. The contracts project probable annualized interest charges for the overnight interbank rate at future dates.   \par \par \uc2 The actual overnight interbank rate rose to 12.38%, up from Friday's close at 12.37%.   \par \par \uc2 -By Bernd Radowitz, Dow Jones Newswires; +5521-3288-5004; bernd.radowitz@dowjones.com   \par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires   \par \par \uc2 06-04-07 0847ET   \par \par \uc2 Dokument OSTDJ00020070604e3640013d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
