\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's Real Closes Weaker After  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 By Bernd Radowitz   \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 305 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Juni 2007\par 21:34\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--The Brazilian real closed weaker Monday following \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said.   \par \par \uc2 The real closed at BRL1.926 against the U.S. dollar in spot contract trading on the Brazilian Mercantile and Futures Exchange, or BM&F, compared with Friday's close at BRL1.90.   \par \par \uc2 Friday's close was the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strongest since Oct. 20, 2000.   \par \par \uc2 The real Friday had strengthened amid heavy dollar inflows, in part from the entrance of several billion dollars in funds for  \uc2 Arcelor Mittal\uc2 's buyout of minority shareholders in its  \uc2 Arcelor\uc2  Brasil unit, scheduled to be finalized Monday.   \par \par \uc2 To stop the real from strengthening further, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday bought an undisclosed amount of dollars in a spot market auction. The bank also held a reverse-swap auction, selling the equivalent of $1.5 billion in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap contracts.   \par \par \uc2 According to traders, the total amount of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday was about $2.5 billion.   \par \par \uc2 The auctions allow investors to swap \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  positions for government paper linked to interest rates. Typically, the auctions help support the U.S. dollar against the Brazilian real by removing real exposure from the market.   \par \par \uc2 The bank Monday afternoon again bought an undisclosed amount of U.S. dollars at a snap auction for BRL1.9279 per dollar.   \par \par \uc2 In local interest rate futures, the most actively traded contract, January 2008, rose to 11.36% from Friday's close at 11.29%. The contracts project probable annualized interest charges for the overnight interbank rate at future dates.   \par \par \uc2 The actual overnight interbank rate remained flat from Friday at 12.38%.   \par \par \uc2 -By Bernd Radowitz, Dow Jones Newswires; +5521-3288-5004; bernd.radowitz@dowjones.com; [ 04-06-07 1934GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020070604e364000vr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
