\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil stocks hit record high,  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2  slips   \b0\par\par\uc2 489 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Mai 2007\par 17:13\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Updates to close)   \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO, May 18 (Reuters) - Brazil's stock index surged to another all-time high on Friday, while the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened on concerns China's decision to raise interest rates and let the yuan trade more freely may hurt investment flows into Latin American markets.   \par \par \uc2 The Bovespa <.BVSP> index of the Sao Paulo Stock Exchange broke through 52,000 points for the first time ever, finishing up 0.86 percent at an all-time high of 52,077.6 points. That topped the previous record, set on Thursday.   \par \par \uc2 Wall Street gains also boosted Brazilian stocks, as well as an upgrade of Brazil's credit rating this week by  \uc2 Standard & Poor's.\par \par \uc2 Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real <BRBY>, weakened 0.46 percent to finish at 1.961 per U.S dollar, after closing the previous day at its strongest level since Jan. 16, 2001.   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  once again during the session to build up foreign reserves and curb the real's gains.   \par \par \uc2 Exporters complain the Brazilian real is too strong and is hurting their sales. Economists say the most effective way to weaken it would be by cutting the benchmark interest rate faster from 12.5 percent.   \par \par \uc2 "We think that with the real at 1.95 (per dollar), it will permit the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to be more aggressive in terms of monetary loosening," said Alexandre Lintz, chief strategist at  \uc2 BNP Paribas.\uc2  "So that would limit the space the real has to gain."   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been cutting rates 25 basis points at a time and many think a 50-basis-point cut will be made at its next monetary policy meeting in June.   \par \par \uc2 Among overseas factors that hit the real, the People's Bank of China raised interest rates and bank reserve requirements while saying it would increase the trading band for the yuan to 0.5 percent from 0.3 percent.   \par \par \uc2 Interest rate futures <0#DIJ:> rose at the BM&F futures exchange in Sao Paulo on bets China's policy changes and potential interest rate rises by other central banks around the world might crimp inflows to Brazil a bit.   \par \par \uc2 At the stock exchange, iron ore miner CVRD , the second-heaviest stock in the Bovespa index, rose 0.67 percent to 73.69 reais.   \par \par \uc2 State-controlled oil company Petrobras , the heaviest-weighted stock in the index, rose 0.98 percent to 46.50 reais. The company signed a deal on Friday with Portuguese oil firms Galp and Partex to search for oil off the coast of Peniche, a fishing village north of Lisbon.   \par \par \uc2 Airline TAM rose 1.44 percent to 59.85 reais after the company said it entered a code-sharing agreement with  \uc2 United Airlines\uc2  that will broaden its flight offerings to clients.   \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-BRAZIL (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|U|D|M|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070518e35i002d0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
