\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil battles to weaken real, stocks hit record   \b0\par\par\uc2 508 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Mai 2007\par 16:32\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Updates to close)   \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO, May 4 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  aggressively \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the national \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday as the real <BRBY> neared 2 per dollar, while stocks climbed to another record high on surging foreign investment.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  held two auctions to buy U.S. dollars on the spot \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, a day after it sold a whopping $3 billion in reverse \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps to curb the real's gains.   \par \par \uc2 The Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  closed 0.3 percent weaker at 2.034 per dollar. It has rallied to a six-year high on surging dollar inflows from exports and as a lofty benchmark interest rate of 12.5 percent lures foreign cash to Latin America's largest country.   \par \par \uc2 "Because of the outrageous inflows we have, the real would be much stronger if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  weren't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Mario Battistel, head of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the Novacao brokerage.   \par \par \uc2 Some said the real has room to gain, especially as the U.S. dollar slides against other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  tools are limited to buying dollars and selling swaps, which are linked to short-term interest rates that cut demand for dollars in the spot market.   \par \par \uc2 "Looking at the \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  of other countries, the real should be worth between 1.85 and 1.95 a dollar," said Marcelo Voss, chief economist at the Liquidez brokerage.   \par \par \uc2 Former \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  directors have said the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  cuts volatility that could cause inflation if the real were to enter a weakening cycle this year or next.   \par \par \uc2 Exporters say sales will suffer if the real rallies more. But exports have continued to rise on high commodities prices, which many economists say drive exports more than the exchange rate.   \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to apply whatever policy it finds most appropriate to contain speculation and increase reserves," Finance Minister Guido Mantega told reporters after a luncheon with business leaders. "We need to avoid an overvaluation."   \par \par \uc2 Soaring profits by Brazilian miner CVRD and higher U.S. bourses pushed up the Bovespa <.BVSP> index of the Sao Paulo Stock Exchange, which closed 0.76 percent higher at 50,597 points. It hit an intraday record of 50,898 after surpassing 50,000 for the first time on Thursday.   \par \par \uc2 Net foreign investment in the Bovespa in April was $1.2 billion in April, the exchange said on Friday, up from $923 million in March.   \par \par \uc2 Interest rates futures <0#DIJ:> at the BM&F futures exchange fell slightly across the yield curve as tame inflation reinforces expectations the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will cut interest rates further this year.   \par \par \uc2 On the stock market, shares of iron ore miner CVRD rose 2.18 percent to close at 74.60 reais after the company reported an 87 percent jump in first-quarter net profit to $2.22 billion.   \par \par \uc2 Bellwether and oil driller Petrobras fell 0.39 percent to 46.02 reais.   \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-BRAZIL (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|M|D|RNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070504e354001ar\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
