\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which bought an unspecified quantity of dollars at BRL2.0607.   \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, in local interest rate markets, the rate on the most liquid futures contract, January 2010, fell to 11.63% from 11.65% at the previous close.   \par \par \uc2 Brazil's interbank overnight rate fell to 12.63% from 12.65%.   \par \par \uc2 -By Gerald Jeffris, Dow Jones Newswires; (5561) 4501-7143; gerald.jeffrisdowjones.com   \par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires   \par \par \uc2 03-26-07 1543ET   \par \par \uc2 Dokument OSTDJ00020070326e33q000de\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
