uying dollars and will sell swaps," said Marcos Forgione, head of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the Souza Barros brokerage.  \par \par \uc2 The real has been gaining on high domestic interest rates, now at 12.75 percent, and strong exports.  \par \par \uc2 At the stock market, bellwether and oil driller Petrobras climbed 2.92 percent to 43.30 reais and banking giant Bradesco rose 3.45 percent to 82.97 reais.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-BRAZIL (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|U|D|M|RNP|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070321e33l001xm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
