der announced on Thursday a deal to buy a minority stake in local rival Vivax with future acquisition of control. Under the deal, each Vivax share will be swapped for 0.5678 preferred share in Net. Vivax shares fell 6 percent to 35.68 reais on Friday.  \par \par \uc2 UBS analysts said in a report they believed Vivax was a good partnership for Net, as their systems would complement each other and ultimately boost Net's earnings.  \par \par \uc2 "Net is buying Vivax with a discount of 8.2 percent compared to our adjusted target price. And that before you include any synergies, which can be relevant," UBS analysts said in a report.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-BRAZIL (UPDATE)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|U|D|M|RNP|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020061014e2ad00004\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
